WEBVTT

01:47.000 --> 01:48.080
Kill!

02:36.560 --> 02:38.080
- My lord.
- Enter the palace to save His Majesty.

03:06.640 --> 03:08.040
No need to protect me. Enter the palace!

03:08.120 --> 03:09.640
- My lord.
- Hurry up!

03:52.920 --> 03:54.960
It's the third day of medication.
Can His Majesty wake up?

03:55.920 --> 03:59.160
No matter what,
it must last for an incense stick.

03:59.240 --> 04:00.280
The Imperial Guards are here.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.320
Don't let them go in.

04:02.240 --> 04:05.440
YANMING PALACE

04:12.160 --> 04:14.840
Your Highness, please stop.

04:15.680 --> 04:16.519
General Zhao,

04:17.680 --> 04:20.640
in the name of Empress Dejia, I swear,

04:21.240 --> 04:24.080
the regicide was committed
by Murong Xuanlie.

04:24.760 --> 04:27.480
My intrusion into the palace
to save the Emperor is necessary.

04:28.200 --> 04:31.360
The Imperial Guards
are the righteous army of the Emperor.

04:31.440 --> 04:33.200
Why resort to fratricidal bloodshed?

04:33.760 --> 04:35.680
Give me another hour

04:35.760 --> 04:38.880
and the truth of loyalty and treachery
will be revealed.

04:38.960 --> 04:41.240
The Crown Prince's execution order
has been issued.

04:41.320 --> 04:44.160
Disobeying means sharing
the same crime as Your Highness.

04:44.240 --> 04:47.400
I am too foolish to discern the truth

04:47.480 --> 04:49.000
and can only follow
the Crown Prince's orders.

04:49.800 --> 04:52.080
My father is now in my hands.

04:52.160 --> 04:54.600
Do you even disregard His Majesty's life?

04:56.360 --> 04:58.320
You can surround us but not attack,

04:58.400 --> 05:00.760
protecting the Emperor
while following orders.

05:00.840 --> 05:02.360
I only need an hour.

05:04.600 --> 05:08.360
Murong Jinghe,
now is the time for your death.

05:17.880 --> 05:18.760
Your Highness.

05:19.800 --> 05:22.720
Zhao Su, by my command,
slay the traitor immediately.

05:22.800 --> 05:24.200
Your Highness, His Majesty--

05:30.800 --> 05:32.600
A reward of 10,000 gold awaits
whoever slays the rebel

05:33.520 --> 05:35.200
Murong Jinghe!

05:35.280 --> 05:37.840
Kill!

05:40.200 --> 05:43.000
Defend Yanming Palace
until the last man stands.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.600
Kill!

06:06.080 --> 06:08.520
The Pingnan Army is a righteous army.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.440
I truly do not wish to aid in wrongdoing.

06:10.520 --> 06:13.880
This battle today,
if won, will reveal the truth.

06:13.960 --> 06:15.960
If lost, both you and I

06:17.080 --> 06:19.480
will be despised as traitors for eternity.

06:20.920 --> 06:22.400
If anyone wishes to retreat today,

06:23.000 --> 06:24.280
I will not hold it against you.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.680
I vow to follow you to the death.

06:26.760 --> 06:29.040
I vow to follow you to the death.

06:29.120 --> 06:30.400
Without a written order
from the Crown Prince,

06:30.480 --> 06:32.000
no soldier shall enter the city.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.400
General Yin, you don't want to be
the Crown Princess.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.880
Are you plotting rebellion
with Prince Jing?

06:55.840 --> 06:56.760
My lord.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.280
- Qingyan.
- My lord.

08:12.440 --> 08:13.960
YANMING PALACE

09:13.200 --> 09:15.200
Rebel!

11:56.720 --> 11:57.840
Where are we going?

11:58.560 --> 11:59.640
Back to Xiyan.

12:06.000 --> 12:08.120
- Stop the carriage.
- For him?

12:08.200 --> 12:09.880
For the lost souls of Qingzhou.

12:10.840 --> 12:12.280
Stop the carriage.

12:15.440 --> 12:17.400
Your Highness, I must go back immediately.

12:17.480 --> 12:19.720
Even if you return,
you can't enter the Imperial Palace.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.640
Prince Jing plans

12:21.720 --> 12:23.360
to forcibly enter Yanming Palace today
to rescue the Emperor.

12:23.440 --> 12:24.600
Once he does,

12:24.680 --> 12:26.080
the Crown Prince will seal
the palace gates

12:26.160 --> 12:27.600
and slaughter all rebels.

12:29.960 --> 12:31.160
- Mei Lin.
- Your Highness.

12:36.680 --> 12:39.120
Your Highness,
there is news from Zhaojing.

12:47.400 --> 12:49.600
The secret report from Zhaojing.
The Emperor has woken up.

12:51.560 --> 12:54.200
The Crown Prince has been imprisoned
for regicide and treason.

12:54.880 --> 12:57.000
Zigu is also fine. You can be relieved.

13:04.200 --> 13:05.280
It's just that Prince Jing is…

14:03.120 --> 14:04.640
You need to rest now.

14:05.720 --> 14:08.920
Don't worry about anything else.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.000
This medicine is so bitter.

14:15.560 --> 14:16.920
We agreed to share
both good and hard times together.

14:18.800 --> 14:19.960
It truly is very bitter.

14:21.280 --> 14:24.880
Jinghe, you have to promise me.

14:24.960 --> 14:27.400
No matter what happens in the future,

14:28.840 --> 14:30.160
don't hide anything from me.

14:37.160 --> 14:40.560
Murong Jinghe, you are a liar.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.360
You promised me to go with me.

14:43.440 --> 14:45.560
Why leave me halfway?

14:55.840 --> 14:56.840
You can't die.

14:58.200 --> 15:01.720
You must pay back
what you promised me yourself.

15:05.880 --> 15:07.000
Murong Jinghe,

15:08.200 --> 15:09.560
you must survive.

15:14.440 --> 15:16.040
The bleeding has stopped.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.800
But he can't take food or medicine.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.800
His life is still in danger.

15:21.120 --> 15:24.600
Whether he can make it
depends on the next day or two.

15:31.280 --> 15:32.480
It's snowing.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.320
Mei.

16:21.520 --> 16:22.560
Jinghe,

16:26.920 --> 16:28.320
you must not die.

16:30.800 --> 16:32.080
Mei,

16:34.120 --> 16:35.640
is it you?

16:55.200 --> 16:56.200
I'm sorry.

17:05.760 --> 17:07.280
The hairpin is broken.

17:09.680 --> 17:11.240
We agreed

17:12.960 --> 17:15.720
I would spend my life making up for it.

17:38.120 --> 17:39.120
Don't go.

17:44.880 --> 17:46.960
There's no lifetime for us together.

17:48.400 --> 17:49.480
Mei.

18:04.680 --> 18:05.640
Mei.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.120
Mei.

18:21.000 --> 18:22.080
Don't go.

18:27.440 --> 18:28.680
Mei Lin.

19:14.000 --> 19:17.440
My lord, you finally woke up. Great!

19:17.520 --> 19:19.880
- My lord.
- Did she come?

19:19.960 --> 19:20.880
She?

19:20.960 --> 19:24.320
I've been in the courtyard
and saw no visitors.

19:24.400 --> 19:26.280
- She came.
- You must be blessed.

19:26.360 --> 19:27.280
Surely it's the luck
of the repaired wedding robe

19:27.360 --> 19:28.960
- from Mei Lin.
- She came.

19:32.240 --> 19:33.560
Wedding robe?

19:43.240 --> 19:45.680
The wedding robe embroidered
by the Empress

19:45.760 --> 19:47.240
had missed stitches, an ominous sign.

19:47.960 --> 19:50.640
When Miss Mei Lin saw it,

19:50.720 --> 19:52.800
I explained the situation.

19:54.760 --> 19:59.840
Later, I learned she quietly
fixed the stitches for you.

20:26.720 --> 20:28.560
It's easier to hold a knife.

20:39.560 --> 20:42.400
It's done. Gods bless us.

20:43.520 --> 20:44.720
We must win.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.200
After we succeed,

20:48.280 --> 20:50.320
I'll give you this wedding robe
personally.

21:23.320 --> 21:25.720
I never expected that after all this,

21:25.800 --> 21:27.800
you would end up marrying my brother.

21:30.880 --> 21:32.880
Now, I finally understand

21:33.800 --> 21:35.400
it's so hard to spend

21:36.280 --> 21:37.840
a lifetime together.

21:38.520 --> 21:42.560
Imperfection is a common part of life.

21:46.920 --> 21:49.040
Are you still in love with Prince Jing?

21:50.280 --> 21:51.480
All debts

21:54.040 --> 21:56.360
and grievances between us are settled.

22:00.720 --> 22:03.360
I once thought fate was unfair,

22:04.040 --> 22:06.520
but it treats everyone the same.

22:07.400 --> 22:09.080
My brother is right.

22:09.160 --> 22:11.400
Do your best and leave the rest to fate.

22:16.520 --> 22:17.360
Mei Lin,

22:18.480 --> 22:21.520
my brother protected you
as the Princess Heir

22:22.160 --> 22:24.240
to repay his debt for saving his life.

22:24.880 --> 22:27.720
But my father believes you are a goddess

22:28.320 --> 22:30.880
and trusts the Sun and Moon Kunluns.

22:31.480 --> 22:34.640
You must return to Xiyan
before the deity's birthday.

22:35.720 --> 22:38.200
Otherwise, my brother's position
as Prince Heir

22:38.280 --> 22:40.240
and your life will be in danger.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.440
In order to save me,

22:44.480 --> 22:46.400
His Highness staked his own future.

22:52.560 --> 22:54.960
- Your Highness, the Prince Heir is here.
- Qin.

22:59.760 --> 23:02.200
Mei Lin, for this trip back to Xiyan,

23:02.280 --> 23:04.640
I won't trap you
with the Princess Heir identity.

23:04.720 --> 23:06.800
I will do everything I can
to grant you freedom,

23:07.440 --> 23:08.480
but until then,

23:08.560 --> 23:11.960
I can only ask you to endure
and play the role of my Princess Heir.

23:12.800 --> 23:14.320
I will try my best

23:15.320 --> 23:17.000
to repay your favor.

23:18.120 --> 23:20.240
Your Highness,
Eunuch Wang is still waiting outside.

23:20.840 --> 23:21.920
The auspicious hour is approaching.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.200
The Prince Heir and the Princess Heir
should be leaving.

23:32.040 --> 23:32.880
Let's go.

23:40.440 --> 23:41.280
We're leaving.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.840
Qin, Mei Lin.

24:06.640 --> 24:10.480
Qin, when Mei Lin is in Xiyan,
you are her only friend.

24:10.560 --> 24:11.920
Don't bully her.

24:13.240 --> 24:14.240
I promise you.

24:19.400 --> 24:22.400
Mei Lin, my brother lacks martial skills.

24:22.480 --> 24:24.000
You can't bully him, either.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.680
Okay, I promise you.

24:28.520 --> 24:29.440
Your Highness.

24:39.400 --> 24:41.800
Well, you can go now.

24:50.440 --> 24:51.760
Qin, Mei Lin.

25:04.200 --> 25:05.040
Well,

25:07.080 --> 25:08.680
there's no bamboo brew
left in Fanghua Palace.

25:09.520 --> 25:11.400
I'll brew it for you
when I return to Xiyan.

25:15.000 --> 25:16.960
You have to brew a lot.

25:17.040 --> 25:18.120
Mei Lin also loves it.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.760
I'll help him brew it.

25:27.200 --> 25:29.560
Hurry and go. Have a safe journey.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.560
We're leaving.

25:44.000 --> 25:45.960
Qin, Mei Lin.

25:53.080 --> 25:53.920
Will we…?

25:54.600 --> 25:56.760
Will we meet again in this lifetime?

25:58.120 --> 25:58.960
Of course.

25:59.600 --> 26:01.480
Once we are free, we'll come to Zhaojing.

26:04.800 --> 26:06.440
We'll definitely meet again.

26:12.880 --> 26:13.720
Well…

26:15.160 --> 26:18.000
Well, go now.

26:18.080 --> 26:21.640
Don't keep His Majesty waiting
or miss the auspicious hour.

26:47.480 --> 26:48.320
We're leaving.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.600
We're leaving.

27:22.640 --> 27:28.360
TAICHI PALACE

27:51.760 --> 27:54.280
"Among my subjects is a young woman
from Qingzhou named Mei Lin,

27:54.360 --> 27:55.800
who has rendered meritorious service

27:55.880 --> 27:57.040
and demonstrated loyalty and obedience.

27:57.120 --> 27:59.480
She is hereby bestowed
the title of Princess Zongshuo,

27:59.560 --> 28:01.160
granted a dowry of 100 palanquins,

28:01.240 --> 28:03.880
and honored as a princess
in a peace-making marriage,

28:03.960 --> 28:06.640
signifying the friendly relations
between our nations,

28:06.720 --> 28:08.400
to take place
with the Prince Heir of Xiyan.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.800
Let those in charge
carry out these orders."

28:12.320 --> 28:13.560
I saved the throne,

28:14.600 --> 28:15.840
not for reward

28:16.680 --> 28:19.880
but to seek the truth
behind the Qingzhou case.

28:20.680 --> 28:22.200
The case of Qingzhou is now

28:22.280 --> 28:24.240
being re-examined by the three ministries.

28:24.760 --> 28:26.480
An accounting will be given to Qingzhou.

28:27.200 --> 28:30.400
You have shown great righteousness,
and I am deeply comforted by this.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.720
From now on,

28:31.800 --> 28:34.760
the royal family of Great Yan
will be your family.

28:34.840 --> 28:37.800
I trust you will, like Concubine Yan,

28:37.880 --> 28:41.840
promote peace between our nations.

28:53.680 --> 28:54.520
Your Highness,

28:55.120 --> 28:57.040
these are the documents

28:57.120 --> 28:59.160
for establishing border trade
in Qingzhou by Great Yan.

28:59.800 --> 29:02.520
As this benefits both nations,

29:02.600 --> 29:07.000
Great Yan is willing
to partner with Xiyan.

29:07.080 --> 29:09.280
Upon returning to Xiyan
with the Princess Heir,

29:09.880 --> 29:12.760
I will discuss border trade with my father

29:12.840 --> 29:13.960
and send envoys

29:14.040 --> 29:16.440
to express our gratitude
to Your Majesty for your assistance.

29:18.800 --> 29:20.960
Your Majesty is wise.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.080
Mei.

32:28.800 --> 32:34.680
ZHAOJING

32:48.440 --> 32:51.760
"Treacherous subject Murong Xuanlie

32:51.840 --> 32:54.080
conspired with a former attendant
in Prince Xian's mansion, Li Qing,

32:54.160 --> 32:56.600
and former Mozhou sheriff Zhang Yin
to seize power.

32:56.680 --> 32:59.360
In the 15th year of the Zhaoming era,
they set fire to Qingzhou

32:59.440 --> 33:00.800
and framed the Weibei Army,

33:00.880 --> 33:02.920
leading to the annihilation
of a righteous army,

33:03.000 --> 33:05.800
countless civilian deaths,

33:05.880 --> 33:07.600
and great hardships for survivors.

33:07.680 --> 33:10.000
They are eternal sinners of Great Yan,

33:10.080 --> 33:11.520
guilty and deserving of execution.

33:11.600 --> 33:13.520
I decree that all authorities
bestow a mausoleum

33:13.600 --> 33:15.520
and inscribe a stele for the Weibei Army

33:15.600 --> 33:17.320
to comfort the loyal spirits.

33:17.400 --> 33:20.240
Qingzhou shall be exempt from taxes
for three years to mourn the deceased.

33:20.320 --> 33:22.000
Let those in charge
carry out these orders."

33:22.600 --> 33:24.680
Your Majesty is wise.

33:25.840 --> 33:28.360
Prince Jing maintained
private armed forces,

33:28.440 --> 33:29.400
which should be punished.

33:29.480 --> 33:31.480
However, his meritorious service
in saving the throne

33:31.560 --> 33:33.200
cancels his merits and demerits.

33:36.200 --> 33:37.240
Thank you, Father.

33:43.320 --> 33:44.240
Yin Luomei

33:44.840 --> 33:47.800
allowed a criminal
to harm a loyal minister.

33:47.880 --> 33:50.120
Given your repentance and service,

33:50.200 --> 33:51.840
the death penalty is waived.

33:52.400 --> 33:55.200
You are stripped of your command
of the Pingnan Army

33:55.280 --> 33:57.680
and demoted to registrar in Mozhou.

33:57.760 --> 34:00.240
You cannot return to Zhaojing
without an imperial edict.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:11.840 --> 34:13.960
I have held the ancestral legacy
for 35 years

34:15.480 --> 34:17.800
and strived diligently.

34:17.880 --> 34:21.480
Yet I failed to raise my sons
and trusted the wrong people.

34:23.400 --> 34:27.520
The disaster in Qingzhou
was also my fault.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.239
I will issue a decree of self-reproach

34:30.880 --> 34:32.960
to remind myself of my duty
to nurture the people

34:34.120 --> 34:36.840
and ensure the realm's peace.

35:01.440 --> 35:03.720
Great, we finally won a battle.

35:03.800 --> 35:05.720
- Happy, huh?
- I'm overjoyed.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.400
I'll tell you something.
My wife sent me a letter,

35:07.480 --> 35:10.040
saying my son can walk now.

35:10.120 --> 35:10.960
Congratulations.

35:11.960 --> 35:14.680
Can you ask your wife
to introduce me a wife?

35:14.760 --> 35:15.720
Sure.

35:15.800 --> 35:16.880
My wife happens to have a younger sister.

35:16.960 --> 35:18.600
I'll talk to her when I'm back.

35:18.680 --> 35:20.040
Really?

35:20.120 --> 35:23.600
That's good.
Our relationship will be even closer.

35:23.680 --> 35:26.760
Mr. Yang, you stay in the camp every year.

35:26.840 --> 35:28.160
Now, the war is over.

35:28.240 --> 35:29.880
You can finally go home.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.760
I'm from Qingzhou.

35:32.840 --> 35:35.240
When Qingzhou is reclaimed, I'm home.

35:35.320 --> 35:36.200
That's true.

35:36.280 --> 35:38.280
The general vowed, "No homecoming
until Xiyan is defeated."

35:38.360 --> 35:40.760
I told my mother
it would take at least ten years,

35:40.840 --> 35:42.480
so I didn't expect to return so soon.

35:42.560 --> 35:43.800
We'll be home soon.

35:43.880 --> 35:44.720
When you are home,

35:44.800 --> 35:46.800
your mother will no longer
have to wait for you at the door.

35:46.880 --> 35:47.720
You are right.

35:47.800 --> 35:52.360
TAICHI PALACE

35:54.800 --> 35:56.120
General.

36:14.600 --> 36:16.840
Weibei Army, report for duty!

36:28.280 --> 36:30.280
Murong Jinghe,

36:32.560 --> 36:33.960
report for duty!

37:54.520 --> 37:57.440
I've imagined countless times
how you look in a wedding robe.

37:59.000 --> 38:01.280
But I never expected
I would be in such a state.

38:02.600 --> 38:04.760
I thought you didn't want to see me again.

38:13.720 --> 38:15.160
Marrying Your Highness

38:16.400 --> 38:18.240
is my wish.

38:22.160 --> 38:25.880
With your words,
I would be happy even if I went to hell.

38:28.320 --> 38:31.680
I have rarely known
true freedom and happiness.

38:32.560 --> 38:33.960
All my beautiful memories

38:35.960 --> 38:37.480
are of you.

38:46.680 --> 38:51.440
Even now, I still recall
every detail of our first meeting.

38:54.840 --> 38:55.960
That year, you were eight.

38:58.320 --> 39:00.360
You stood up for me
against the young masters

39:01.320 --> 39:02.240
of the Marquis's Mansion,

39:04.520 --> 39:07.120
saying you wouldn't tolerate bullying.

39:08.440 --> 39:11.240
Thinking back, that was my first fight,

39:13.000 --> 39:14.080
and it was exhilarating.

39:15.840 --> 39:18.680
Later, I learned
that the eight-year-old girl

39:18.760 --> 39:19.920
was the General's daughter.

39:21.400 --> 39:23.680
Each time you visited the Noble Consort,

39:23.760 --> 39:25.440
I found excuses to go to Fengyi Palace.

39:26.840 --> 39:29.000
Eventually, the Noble Consort noticed,

39:29.080 --> 39:32.440
and I had to use Jinghe as an excuse.

39:36.200 --> 39:37.800
Now, I think about it…

39:40.840 --> 39:42.120
You liked me that early?

39:43.400 --> 39:45.520
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

39:45.600 --> 39:47.240
I didn't dare.

39:49.880 --> 39:51.000
Do you know?

39:51.800 --> 39:53.440
For every time I looked at you,

39:53.520 --> 39:55.720
you looked at Jinghe just as often.

40:00.520 --> 40:02.400
Even if I had confessed,

40:03.440 --> 40:04.760
you would only choose him.

40:04.840 --> 40:08.240
But if you had told me earlier,

40:08.760 --> 40:10.280
the outcome might have been different.

40:13.040 --> 40:13.880
Would it?

40:23.720 --> 40:24.720
Yes.

40:32.320 --> 40:33.920
But if you chose me,

40:36.760 --> 40:38.160
I wouldn't dare

40:39.760 --> 40:41.640
risk losing you.

41:32.000 --> 41:35.760
To die by your hand
would complete my life.

41:45.640 --> 41:47.200
As General Yin, I offered you
the poisonous wine.

41:47.960 --> 41:49.040
As Luomei,

41:50.120 --> 41:51.400
I wish to drink cross-cup wine with you.

43:08.920 --> 43:09.760
Luomei,

43:10.640 --> 43:13.720
what kind of husband do you want?

43:15.560 --> 43:16.640
Me?

43:18.640 --> 43:21.960
This man must be able to defeat me.

43:23.280 --> 43:24.800
What else?

43:26.920 --> 43:27.960
He

43:29.600 --> 43:31.440
must allow me to lead troops into battle.

43:33.760 --> 43:34.800
What else?

43:37.000 --> 43:38.240
He…

43:41.960 --> 43:43.600
must confess to me sooner.

43:59.400 --> 44:00.240
Fine.

44:01.560 --> 44:04.440
In our next life, let's marry earlier.

44:10.960 --> 44:12.120
With you watching over me,

44:13.680 --> 44:15.480
I won't choose the wrong path.

44:17.640 --> 44:18.480
Fine.
